Convert the question into JSON. Output only JSON. Keys: m metric (speed,wind,wave_height,water_temp); a aggregation (avg default,min,max); b time bucket in minutes (1 for by minute,60 for hourly); h trailing window in HOURS (multiply days by 24); s true for comparing vessels, false otherwise; v null for all vessels; c line by default,surface for 3D surface. Minute is a time bucket, not minimum aggregation.
Examples:
Compare vessel speed by minute over the last 2 days => {"m":"speed","a":"avg","b":1,"h":48,"s":true,"v":null,"c":"line"}
Compare vessel wind by hour over the last 3 days as a 3D surface => {"m":"wind","a":"avg","b":60,"h":72,"s":true,"v":null,"c":"surface"}
